nI’ll stay right here, count me in  \n\n[Chorus]\nStay right there, don’t pull it straight  \nI love how we arrive late  \nOff the grid but locked in time  \nThat lazy swing feels like mine  \n\nYeah we bend, we drift, we sway  \nLet tomorrow wait its turn today  \nIf love lives just off the line  \nSoft kick drum, your hand in mine  \n\n[Outro - Guitar Riff & Final Chord]\nno rush…\nno rush…\njust groove…\n", 31, "fixed", 105, 180, "4", "zh", "E minor", true, 2, 0.85, 0.9, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 244, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "link": 262, "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 263, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 257, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 251, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyscale"}, {"widget": {"name": "generate_audio_codes"}, "name": "generate_audio_codes", "label": "generate_audio_codes", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "generate_audio_codes"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}